==English==

===Etymology===
From {{bor|en|hi|गरम मसाला||hot spice}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# A mixture of [[spice]]s used in [[Indian]] dishes, such as [[coriander]], [[cumin]], [[clove]]s, [[cinnamon]], [[nutmeg]], [[star anise]], and [[chilli]]s.

